OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, clear start with frost
OL,6,Fin places. Then remaining dry and
OL,7,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,8,Fsunshine and just a few patches of
OL,9,Fcloud in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and settled overnight
OL,12,Fwith light winds and largely clear
OL,13,Fskies. Turning cold again, with a
OL,14,Ffrost developing across many areas by
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FAnother cold start with a risk
OL,18,Fof frost in places. Remaining dry and
OL,19,Fsettled during the day with lengthy
OL,20,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
